Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|osgi.app.includes|social-bookmarks|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|plugins.deployment.type|osgi|
		|testray.main.component.name|Social Networking|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG

Scenario: Social Bookmarks Hook Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|appName|Social Bookmarks|
	When these variables
		|portletName|social-bookmarks-hook|
	Then OSGiSmoke Smoke
		|appName|${portletName}|
		|portletName|${portletName}|